<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>On Fye</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">The Simps, Eyedress, zzzahara</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Siblings</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6qLQ0K5jkOB0QrbDwNmKg9</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.364" end="00:15.543">I’m on fire for the first time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:15.543" end="00:20.833">I’m on fire it’s been a long time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.833" end="00:26.031">And my new girl, she brings out my shine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.031" end="00:31.238">And I’m sipping on this red wine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.238" end="00:36.580">For the first time it all seems alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.580" end="00:39.177">I ain’t hurting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.177" end="00:41.815">I’m not in pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.815" end="00:45.353">It feels uncommon, but I will take it,</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.353" end="00:53.353">I will take it and make it mine.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.582" end="01:04.667">It’s been awhile</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.667" end="01:07.616">Since ive seen you cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.616" end="01:09.985">For the first time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.985" end="01:13.176">I feel alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.176" end="01:15.525">Don’t let me go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.525" end="01:18.188">I’m not going through this again</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.188" end="01:20.565">I love you so</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.565" end="01:23.599">Just tell me what you want</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.599" end="01:26.013">If there’s a problem</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.013" end="01:27.513">Then i’ll take it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.659" end="01:28.159">And i’ll take it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.833" end="01:33.846">And make it right</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.846" end="01:36.555">If this is what it takes to be with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.555" end="01:39.922">I’ll do anything for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.922" end="01:44.177">Anything for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.177" end="01:46.835">You came to me as a surprise</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.835" end="01:49.585">She met me at the right time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.585" end="01:51.412">She’s so good for my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.412" end="01:52.912">Good for my mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.716" end="01:56.716">Good for my mind</p></div></body></tt>